# Global runtime deps for things this repo does NOT install via a module
# script, but still relies on being present after a restore — external
# tools that are only backed up/restored (config + binary), not set up here.
#
# Read by setup-customarchy.sh's restore-time deps mechanism (collect_deps):
# every `deps` file anywhere under scripts/ is globbed and its packages are
# installed if missing (`sudo pacman -S --needed`). Module-specific deps
# (e.g. scripts/apps/zen/deps) stay colocated with their own module;
# this file is for cases with no module folder of their own.
#
# - omagrab (https://github.com/28allday/omagrab): the user's own external
#   tool, backed up/restored as ~/.local/bin/omagrab + ~/.config/omagrab.
yt-dlp
ffmpeg
wl-clipboard
